WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:05.993
The Inbox, two unread emails among read ones.

00:00:05.993 --> 00:00:08.886
Mail preferences, Deleting: the option that decides what opens after a delete.

00:00:08.886 --> 00:00:12.393
Pick the option. The example under it shows what a delete leaves open.

00:00:12.393 --> 00:00:12.908
Open an email.

00:00:12.908 --> 00:00:15.788
Delete it from the reader.

00:00:15.788 --> 00:00:17.967
The reader already shows the email the option picked.
